{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03054","headline":"园中时蔬尽皆锄理唯秋兰数本委而不顾彼虽一物有足悲者遂赋二章 二 · 张九龄","name":"园中时蔬尽皆锄理唯秋兰数本委而不顾彼虽一物有足悲者遂赋二章 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幸得不锄去，孤苗守旧根。\n无心羡旨蓄，岂欲近名园。\n遇赏宁充佩，爲生莫碍门。\n幽林芳意在，非是爲人论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}